.jpg 1000w, https://forbes.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/fotonoticia_20240209114159_1920-400x266.jpg 400w, https://forbes.es/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/fotonoticia_20240209114159_1920-600x400.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /></noscript>				            </figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->

